# Online Food Delivery App (Python)

A simple console-based Online Food Delivery Application built using Python.  
This project simulates the basic workflow of a food delivery system.

## 🔹 Features
- User login authentication
- Restaurant menu display
- Food ordering with quantity
- Bill calculation
- Order confirmation
- Delivery status simulation

## 🛠 Technologies Used
- Python
- Git & GitHub

## 🧠 Python Concepts Used
- Dictionaries
- Conditional statements (if-else)
- Loops
- User input handling
- Basic arithmetic operations
- time.sleep() for simulation

